### Submit code challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "code", "value": "12345"}

### Submit password challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "password", "value": "REPLACE_2FA"}

### Submit email challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "email", "value": "owner@example.com"}

### Submit emailCode challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "emailCode", "value": "12345"}
